cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its published data, please cite it as below."
title: "gnssguard: GNSS interference detection from open ADS-B data"
type: software
authors:
  - name: sahilprg
    alias: sahilprg
abstract: >-
  Detects GPS jamming and spoofing that affects aircraft from free, open ADS-B flight
  data (adsb.lol), in 1-degree cells and 15-minute windows, and publishes a nightly map
  and open data files. Every evaluation is declared before it is run
  (docs/evaluation_protocol.md) and regenerated with input hashes by
  `gnssguard benchmark`. Version 0.2.0 fixes the model (hash 81062b5eb365) and the
  scoring rules of the sealed test before its sample is drawn.
identifiers:
